        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akili Smith, Tim Couch, Donovan McNabb\n- Organizations: Cincinnati Bengals, Cleveland Browns, Philadelphia Eagles, University of Kentucky\n- Events: 1999 NFL Draft\n- Topics: college football, All-America honors, NFL draft order\n\nFacts:\n- Tim Couch played college football for the University of Kentucky and earned All-America honors.\n- In the 1999 NFL Draft, Tim Couch was selected first overall by the Cleveland Browns.\n- In the 1999 NFL Draft, Donovan McNabb was selected after Tim Couch by the Philadelphia Eagles.\n- In the 1999 NFL Draft, Akili Smith was drafted third overall in the first round by the Cincinnati Bengals.\n- Akili Smith was the third quarterback selected in the first three picks of the 1999 NFL Draft, behind Tim Couch and Donovan McNabb.",
